  1) [1, 2, 3]        ->  e(1) + 2*e(2) + 3*e(3)
  2) [0, 1, 2, 3]     ->  e(2) + 2*e(3) + 3*e(4)
  3) [1, 0, 3, 4]     ->  e(1) + 3*e(3) + 4*e(4)
  4) [1, 2, 0]        ->  e(1) + 2*e(2)
  5) [0, 0, 0]        ->  0
  6) [0]              ->  0
  7) [1, 1, 1]        ->  e(1) + e(2) + e(3)
  8) [-1, -1, -1]     ->  -e(1) - e(2) - e(3)
  9) [-1, -2, 0, -3]  ->  -e(1) - 2*e(2) - 3*e(4)
 10) [-1]             ->  -e(1)
